    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market this very impressive, bright & spacious, own door entrance, ground-floor apartment. Windmill Square is a modern, attractive, highly sought after living destination. \n\nBenefiting from well proportioned accommodation and light filled living spaces throughout. Accommodation comprises of entrance, open-plan living / dining / kitchen, two bedrooms (master en-suite) and a main bathroom. This apartment is sure to please even the most discerning of buyers.\n\nOne of the outstanding features of this property are the wonderful, meticulously maintained, mature, landscaped, communal grounds and gardens. The apartment benefits from residents parking, as well as ample visitor parking.\n\nWindmill Square is ideally located just off the Clonsilla Road and is easily accessible to a host of amenities, such as well serviced high frequency bus routes, including pedestrian access to Coolmine Railway Station (offering approx. 20 min travel time to the City). Blanchardstown Shopping Village, Roselawn Shopping Centre, Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, James Connolly Memorial Hospital and The National Aquatic Centre. Windmill Square is also immediately accessible to the N3/M3/M50 road networks.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 1.68m x 1.49m\nWith alarm point and boiler newly fitted.\n\nLiving Room - 6m x 4.70m\nOpenplan room with wood flooring, tv point and bespoke blinds.\n\nKitchen - 3.14m x 1.70m\nModern kicthen in excellent condition, with wall and base units. Appliances to include, electric hob and oven, dishwasher, washing machine and fridge/freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.67m x 2.78m\nDouble room with fitted wardrobes.\n\nEn-Suite - 1.83m x 1.36m\nWc, whb, shower and extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.61m x 1.80m\nWith fitted wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 2.01m x 1.91m\nBathroom has been recently upgraded and has wc, whb, bath with shower unit and extractor fan.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Impressive, two bed, ground-floor apartment approx. 61sqm / 656sqft</li><li> Built c.2004</li><li> Mid-block apartment</li><li> Meticulous communal landscaped grounds & gardens</li><li> Bright & spacious throughout</li><li> Double glazed windows</li><li> Gas central heating (modern boiler)</li><li> Burglar alarm</li><li> Turn key condition with immaculate interiors</li><li> Excellent standard of finish throughout</li><li> Residents & visitors parking</li><li> High quality residential development</li><li> Within close proximity of a host of amenities & well serviced public transport links</li><li> Coolmine trainstation only a 5 minute walk.</li><li> Management fee - approx. 1,150</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
